  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GRET Improve rural Malian youth employability tutorial apprenticeship</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective is to develop a suitable apprenticeship framework that enables young rural Malians to acquire the necessary core competencies in order to meet the needs of rural economy and job market and therefore access to gainful employment.</narrative>
  </description>
